            "review_text": "DiscoverWorkTravel\nCologne, Germany162 contributions\n0\nsuper tasty\nApr 2024 • Couples\nReview Highlights:\n\nBasement Charm: Phở Ong Cat Gia Truyền is a cozy basement place that exudes an unpretentious charm. It’s not about fancy decor; it’s about honest, hearty food.\nBeef Balls and Noodles: I had the beef balls and noodles, and they were delicious. The flavors were comforting and satisfying. Sometimes, the simplest dishes are the most memorable.\nQuick Bite: If you’re looking for a quick bite to eat, this place is perfect. The service is efficient, and the value for money is excellent.\nOverall Verdict: Phở Ong Cat Gia Truyền Since 1988 is a spot where locals and visitors alike can enjoy authentic Vietnamese flavors without breaking the bank. Don’t expect frills—just good food! 🍜👌\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 21, 2024",
